# The human attacks the Siege it controls, protected by ai (a battle is
# attacked by its protector's opponents, CombatUtil.java:66-73). The player
# defending against that attack is the protector, not the controller
# (Combat.getDefenderPlayerByAttacker, Combat.java:297-299), so ai declares
# blockers: Hill Giant (3/3) blocks Silvercoat Lion (2/2) and kills it, and the
# battle keeps all five defense counters. The human's untapped Grizzly Bears is
# never offered as a blocker of its own attack, which the controller-as-
# defender reading did.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
queue attacktarget 2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 3=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
